Z||000017||My7Fieros||12-11-2001||02:33 AM||||Coke rules, Pepsi taste like sh1t. About once every 6 months I'll drink a Pepsi just for something different. I usually dont make it all the way through the can (or bottle). Pepsi is wayyyyyyy too sweet. <BR>I prob drink 5 or 6 Cokes a day. (eek!) <BR>Now, on the other hand, if I were forced to drink a diet cola (and Im convinced that is what hell would be), I'd drink Diet Pepsi. Diet Coke is by far the absolute worst drink ever made. Its weird, I know alot of people who will drink Diet Coke only...No regular Coke, no Pepsi, just Diet Coke....yikes! (insert the smilie that throws up here).<BR>But for regular "leaded" softdrinks, Coke over Pepsi. BTW rayb, you're the only person I know that can take a "coke vs. pepsi" and complain about it being some sort of conspiracy.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> LOL Stimpy!<p>[This message has been edited by My7Fieros (edited 12-11-2001).]||||reg||1
