Z||000027||TRiAD||12-11-2001||09:54 AM||||Here's an odd reply for you...<P>I prefer Coke, Pepsi is flat, but I've noticed out east; they trade places. People on the east coast say Coke tastes flat, and Pepsi is fizzier, whereas in the midwest, Pepsi is flat. <P>Could it be the water is that different where they're processed at?!<P>Anyway, for Ray's question; Coke and Pepsi often make a CONTRACT with restaurants, schools, etc, to be the ONLY choice at their establishment. <P>Pepsico also OWNS KFC (Kentucky Fried Chicken), Taco Bell, and Pizza Hut. You WON'T find Coke there...(If you were looking for a religious connection; Pepsi is also a Mormon-owned company, like Disney.)<P>Oh, and I've never tried it, but I HAD to buy a can of this...it was just too funny!<P> <IMG SRC="http://communities.msn.com/_Secure/0MQB1CXUROa3BDuFFGJZHbaKFyfwxRvQFzNiwkQ6t0N6utq8UTBY*aUiBOXSU3oAQkFD7loV8JwAWHVloyQ!lzw/whoop.jpg"> <P><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://communities.msn.com/_Secure/0NgAAAMsSN*Wryq60N*CeWB!hXjfeIaMEc1YxPH9aPzaIXm!17ZpdBFE0Yk*d*dHNFG*GR3SFyLa8KJgh1IKe2Q/xmas-sig.jpg">       <BR><B><I><FONT COLOR="red">Merry Christmas!</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="blue">Project MR1 ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</B><BR>Photoshop rendition of planned modifications<BR>AIM ~ Michael Blue 72</I></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000028||frontal lobe||12-11-2001||04:51 PM||||Diet Coke.  I hate diet pepsi.<P>Conversation in a restaurant:<P>"What would you like to drink?"<BR>"Diet Coke, please."<BR>"Diet Pepsi o.k.?"<BR>"O.K."<P>instead of what I am thinking, but I am not going to take it out on some poor waitress who was not even remotely involved in the decision making (conspiracy?) process of selecting the soft drinks.<P>"No, that would NOT be o.k.  I HATE diet pepsi.  If I had wanted diet pepsi, I would have asked for it.  I really want diet coke, but since I can't have it, and I DO want your food, I guess I will choke down the diet pepsi."||||reg||1
