Z||000056||TRiAD||12-13-2001||10:17 AM||||Another useless fact:<P>Coca Cola was originally <FONT COLOR="green">GREEN</FONT>, and was a "headache elixir". Main pharmaceudical ingredient? <B>Cocaine</B>. <P>Caffeine was substituted when cocaine was determined to be highly addictive and dangerous. Caffeine was added <I>because</I> it was/is also addictive, but it's considered to be not as dangerous. <P>Did you know?<BR>You WILL get MAJOR headaches is you adjust your caffeine intake greatly? That is, you can have a lot MORE or LESS and it will have the same effect. Caffeine is thought to be the next most addictive substance after nicotine (not first and second, just in order). <P>The Mormon religion does not drink ANY caffeine (tea, soda, coffee), yet Pepsico (which also owns KFC, Taco Bell and Pizza Hut) and Disney are Mormon-owned and all serve caffinated drinks.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Soda's an interesting thing. <BR>||||reg||1
